zΔ⚡b|=109|-1|=1|+<tt>|=5|-1|+''orig|=1|-1|+nal''  ''new''</tt>%0A%0A%3D%3DExample%3D%3D%0A%0A{%7C cla|=1|+s%3D"prettytable"%0A%7C%2D valign%3D"|=2|+p"%0A%7C%0A''origi|=1|+al_fil|=5|+'':%0A%0A|=1|+Thi|=1|+ part of th|=1|-1|+ d|=1|+cume|=1|+t has staye|=1|+%0A the same from versi|=2|+ to v|=1|+rsion|=1|+ %0A %0A This paragraph con|=1|+ains te|=2|-1|+ that is|=1|-4|+ |=1|-2|+utd|=1|+ted %2D it wil|=2|-3|+be de|=1|-1|+reca|=1|-3|+ed and|=1|-1|+ deleted in t|=3|+near futu|=2|-3|+.%0A %0A I|=2|+is i|=1|-3|+portan|=2|-2|+t|=1|-1|=1|+spe|=1|-1|+l chec|=1|-1|=5|-1|+ |=2|-1|+dokument. On the other h|=1|-1|+nd|=1|-1|+ a misspelled|=2|-1|+word isn't the end of the world.%0A%7C %0A''new_file.txt'':%0A%0A|=28|-2|=2b|-2|=10|-6|=2|-2|=8|+t of the document h|=1|-2|+s st|=1|-1|+yed%0A t|=1|+e|=1|-1|+same from versi|=2|+ |=1|-1|+o vers|=1|+o|=1|+. %0A %0A It i|=2|+impor|=1|-2|+an|=3|+o spell c|=1|-2|+eck|=1|+th|=2|+ |=2|-2|+d|=1|+c|=1|+men|=1|-2|+. On |=1|+h|=1|+ other han|=1|+,|=1|-1|+a|=1|+m|=1|-1|+sspelled %0A|=2|+ord |=1|-2|+sn't|=1|-1|+th|=2|+en|=1|+ of th|=1|+ world. This %0A |=1|+arag|=1|-1|+aph |=1|+ont|=1|+ins impor|=1|+ant n|=1|-1|+w%0A|=2|-1|+d|=1|-1|+itions|=1|-1|+to this|=2|+ocum|=1|+nt.%0A%7C}%0A%0A%3D%3D%3DNorma|=1|-1|+ outpu|=1|+%3D%3D%3D%0ATh|=1|-1|=1|-1|+comma|=1|+d|=1|+<|=1|-1|+t>diff original_fil|=1|+.txt|=3|-1|+w_file.txt</tt> p|=1|+oduces the|=2|+ollowing o|=2|+p|=1|-3|+t:%0A%0A 0a1,4|=2|-1|+>|=29|-1|+>|=2b|-1|+>|=11|-1|+> %0A |=2|-8|+7d7|=4|+Thi|=1|+ |=1|+aragraph contains t|=1|+xt that is%0A < outdated %2D it wi|=3|+be depre|=1|+ated and%0A < deleted in t|=2|+ near future.%0A < %0A 9,10|=1|-1|+9,12%0A|=1|-4|+<|=17|-3|=7|-1|+a|=1|-3|+misspel|=1|+e|=1|+%0A|=1|-1|+< w|=1|+rd|=1|-1|=1|+sn't |=2|+e|=1|-3|=1|+nd|=1|-1|+of t|=1|+e w|=1|-1|=1|-2|+ld|=a|-11|=16|-3|=7|-1|+a|=1|-3|+misspe|=1|+le|=1|+%0A|=1|-2|+>|=2|+ord |=1|+sn't |=2|+e|=1|-1|+end |=1|-2|+f|=1|-1|+t|=1|+e w|=1|-1|=1|-2|+ld|=1|-3|=5|+ %0A >|=24e|+ Unified format is usually invoked using the "%2Du" [[command line option]]|=d4|+.%0A%0AThe command <tt>diff %2Du original_file.txt new_file.txt</tt> produces the following output:%0A%0A %2D%2D%2D original_file.txt   ''timestamp''%0A %2B%2B%2B new_file.txt        ''timestamp''%0A @@ %2D1,10 %2B1,12 @@%0A %2BThis is an important notice! It should%0A %2Btherefore be located at the beginning of%0A %2Bthis document!%0A %2B%0A  This part of the document has stayed%0A  the same from version to version. %0A  %0A %2DThis paragraph contains text that is%0A %2Doutdated %2D it will be deprecated and%0A %2Ddeleted in the near future.%0A %2D%0A  It is important to spell check this %0A %2Ddokument. On the other hand, a misspelled%0A %2Dword isn't the end of the world.%0A %2Bdocument. On the other hand, a misspelled%0A %2Bword isn't the end of the world. This %0A %2Bparagraph contains important new%0A %2Badditions to this document|=2055|
