# 000200-000299/20060810T032920Z_68749112.wiki
zΔ⚡b|=e16|+Context format %3D%3D%3D%0A%0AThe command <tt>diff %2Dc original_file.txt new_file.txt</tt> produces the following output:%0A%0A  *** /path/to/original_file.txt ''timestamp''%0A  %2D%2D%2D /path/to/new_file.txt      ''timestamp''%0A  ***************%0A  *** 1,3 ****%0A  %2D%2D%2D 1,9 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A  %2B This is an important%0A  %2B notice! It should%0A  %2B therefore be located at%0A  %2B the beginning of this%0A  %2B document!%0A  %2B%0A    This part of the%0A    document has stayed the%0A    same from version to%0A  ***************%0A  *** 5,20 ****%0A    be shown if it doesn't%0A    change.  Otherwise, that%0A    would not be helping to%0A  ! compress the size of the%0A  ! changes.%0A  !%0A  ! This paragraph contains%0A  ! text that is outdated.%0A  ! It will deleted in the%0A  ! near future.%0A  %0A    It is important to spell%0A  ! check this dokument. On%0A    the other hand, a%0A    misspelled word isn't%0A    the end of the world.%0A  %2D%2D%2D 11,20 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A    be shown if it doesn't%0A    change.  Otherwise, that%0A    would not be helping to%0A  ! compress anything.%0A  %0A    It is important to spell%0A  ! check this document. On%0A    the other hand, a%0A    misspelled word isn't%0A    the end of the world.%0A  ***************%0A  *** 22,24 ****%0A  %2D%2D%2D 22,28 %2D%2D%2D%2D%0A    this paragraph needs to%0A    be changed.  Things can%0A    be added after it.%0A  %2B%0A  %2B This paragraph contains%0A  %2B important new additions%0A  %2B to this document.%0A%0A%3D%3D%3D |=28d|-23|+''timestamp''|=19|-23|+''timestamp''|=20b4|
